{"id":"0c7c8d1473c7d455","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-smullyan-finite-set-lemma.md","title":"The Finite Set Lemma","display":"thm-smullyan-finite-set-lemma — The Finite Set Lemma","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-smullyan-finite-set-lemma","aliases":["92-thm-smullyan-finite-set-lemma"],"display":"thm-smullyan-finite-set-lemma — The Finite Set Lemma","source":"第 IV 章 pp. 45–46，Lemma K（PDF 62–63）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-smullyan-finite-pair-code]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-smullyan-finite-set-lemma"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-smullyan-finite-set-lemma</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-smullyan-finite-set-lemma — The Finite Set Lemma"},{"key":"source","html":"第 IV 章 pp. 45–46，Lemma K（PDF 62–63）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9e6768aadf6214a6\" href=\"?note=9e6768aadf6214a6\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-finite-pair-code\">92-df-smullyan-finite-pair-code</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\)</span> 为任意有限集合，可为空；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_E\">\\(K_E\\)</span> 是上一节点的确定关系。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell_{13}\">\\(\\ell_{13}\\)</span> 为规范十三进制位长；框架 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_L\">\\(f_L\\)</span> 的位串为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2\\,1^L\\,2\">\\(2\\,1^L\\,2\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}finite\\text{-}set\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\\quad\n\\forall A\\in[\\mathbb N^2]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\n(\n\\exists z\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n[K_E(x,y,z)\\leftrightarrow(x,y)\\in A]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}finite\\text{-}set\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\\quad\n\\forall A\\in[\\mathbb N^2]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\n(\n\\exists z\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n[K_E(x,y,z)\\leftrightarrow(x,y)\\in A]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明：枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\{(a_1,b_1),\\ldots,(a_n,b_n)\\}\">\\(A=\\{(a_1,b_1),\\ldots,(a_n,b_n)\\}\\)</span>，取\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L&gt;\\max(\\{1\\}\\cup\\{\\ell_{13}(a_i),\\ell_{13}(b_i):1\\leq i\\leq n\\})\">\\(L&gt;\\max(\\{1\\}\\cup\\{\\ell_{13}(a_i),\\ell_{13}(b_i):1\\leq i\\leq n\\})\\)</span>。\n采用位串\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ff\\,a_1f b_1\\,ff\\,a_2f b_2\\,ff\\cdots a_nf b_n\\,ff\">\\(ff\\,a_1f b_1\\,ff\\,a_2f b_2\\,ff\\cdots a_nf b_n\\,ff\\)</span>，其中 f=<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_L\">\\(f_L\\)</span>，并按左结合读成自然数 z；n=0 时取 ff。</p>\n<p>载荷比 f 内的 1 块短，故 f 既不在载荷内，也不可能被载荷边缘的 1 块与分隔符拼成更长框架；z 的最长框架恰为 f。双框架标出数对边界，单框架分开两分量，因此 K 的匹配恰好选出那些数对。空集合编码 ff 不够容纳完整的五框架匹配，故没有成员。</p>\n<p>这里采用“框架的 1 块比全部载荷位串长”的安全选择，显式覆盖跨边界情形；不用未经检查的“只比载荷内部现有框架长”代替。重复枚举不改变被编码的集合，且此定理不要求 z 唯一。</p>\n<p>边界反例：若载荷的十三进制位串为 21111，内部没有完整框架，选择 f=212 虽比所有内部框架长，拼接到下一个 f 的首位 2 后却出现更长的 211112。本文要求 L 大于整段载荷位长，明确避免此问题。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-smullyan-finite-pair-code","status":"resolved","id":"9e6768aadf6214a6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-finite-pair-code]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2","display":false},{"tex":"K_E","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell_{13}","display":false},{"tex":"f_L","display":false},{"tex":"2\\,1^L\\,2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}finite\\text{-}set\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\\quad\n\\forall A\\in[\\mathbb N^2]^{<\\omega}\\;\n(\n\\exists z\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n[K_E(x,y,z)\\leftrightarrow(x,y)\\in A]).","display":true},{"tex":"A=\\{(a_1,b_1),\\ldots,(a_n,b_n)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"L>\\max(\\{1\\}\\cup\\{\\ell_{13}(a_i),\\ell_{13}(b_i):1\\leq i\\leq n\\})","display":false},{"tex":"ff\\,a_1f b_1\\,ff\\,a_2f b_2\\,ff\\cdots a_nf b_n\\,ff","display":false},{"tex":"f_L","display":false}],"bytes":1993,"backlinks":[{"id":"bf4e24a615d3695e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-proof-code]]、[[92-thm-smullyan-finite-set-lemma]]、[[92-thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1]]"},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-34","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"无指数算术化：[[92-df-smullyan-arithmetic-classes]] → [[92-df-smullyan-divisibility-prime-power]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-prime-concatenation]] → [[92-df-smullyan-base-parts]] → [[92-df-smullyan-frames]] → [[92-df-smullyan-finite-pair-code]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-finite-set-lemma]]。"},{"id":"681d4278bd359695","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"75a1feabdeb282fb","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-311","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-smullyan-finite-set-lemma]]"}],"outgoing":["9e6768aadf6214a6"]}